# KA Engineering Agent

AI-assisted structural survey interpretation and CAD drawing generation.

## Roof Support Layout process

Start with the [saved workflow](docs/roof-support-layout-workflow.md),
[reusable rules](docs/roof-support-layout-rules.json),
[KA sheet standard](docs/drawing-sheet-standard.md) and
[empty project template](templates/roof-support-project.json).
Agent entry instructions are in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

The workflow applies to any site. Previous project dimensions and geometry are
not defaults. The saved procedure does not imply that a general automatic survey
interpreter has already been implemented.

## Bespoke site items

See the [bespoke-item workflow](docs/bespoke-site-items-workflow.md),
[rules](docs/bespoke-site-items-rules.json) and
[empty item record](templates/bespoke-site-item.json). Photographs and dimensioned
sketches inform one model, which supplies plan/elevation drawings and a matching
3D rendered view when requested. Confirm outputs before starting each item: a
3D-model-only commission is supported. Deliver only the selected PDF/DWG/model/render
outputs. Combine views on one sheet where legible. This is a separate
process from Roof Support Layout; it is a process definition, not an implemented
general modelling engine.
